Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of light in order for Agumon and Gabumon\Nto digivolve to their mega level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it was weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.98,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Two Great Ultimate Evolutions!\N\NBeat Down the Darkness!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaboobah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warp Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.05,0:03:26.14,Sign,,0,0,115,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1\c&H49ABE1&}WarGreymon{{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.05,0:03:26.14,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.05,0:03:26.14,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.05,0:03:26.14,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Dragon Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.05,0:03:26.14,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.05,0:03:26.14,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Gaia Force
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says here his attack is Gaia Force,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gathering the energy around him and\Nfocusing it in the palm of his hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.47,0:03:36.82,Sign,,0,0,115,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1\c&HCFEADA&}MetalGarurumon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.47,0:03:36.82,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.47,0:03:36.82,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.47,0:03:36.82,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.47,0:03:36.82,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.47,0:03:36.82,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cocytus Breath
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Garurumon has his\NMetal Wolf Claw attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shoots a powerful cold blast at his\Nenemies, then blows them to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega-Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They digivolved into\Ntheir Mega-Digimon forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, because we'll need\Nthem to beat VenomMyotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's for sure.\NGood luck. I'll wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Wharf! Re-run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You creamed him, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get after him, WarGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put his lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your miserable attempts\Nto destroy me have failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you will pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get clear of the van!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jim, how's Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any improvement yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, still exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm tired of fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to defeat my oldest\Nmom once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our parents always protected us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time we came through for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, if we do it\Ntogether, we can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try. You will? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll keep on trying, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Digimon never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like they always say,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all for mon and mon for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to excuse Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a little hyperactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.82,0:05:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take care of our parents, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.76,0:06:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, Archibald!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left it! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the others have Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's Gokimon and Tokomon and Bergamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, attack at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, how about a little needle spring?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the face of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now to wind things up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megaclaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're going to defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've only awakened the beast with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Devourer, you so-called Digidestined!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've stood in my way for the last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't end like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've let everyone down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have done more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible he survived that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is scarier than the movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? My crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, look at your crests!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all starting to glow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Digidestined!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you and your lousy crests!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega-freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that monster represents\NMyotismon's actual form, or Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass me the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice pass! Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra-Forge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be Joe and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it, Todd. We did it. Dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job, Snimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, a stray Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was Gatomon.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.03,0:10:45.54,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Plotmon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.03,0:10:45.54,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Child
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.03,0:10:45.54,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.03,0:10:45.54,Sign,,380,0,225,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mammal Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.03,0:10:45.54,Sign,,380,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.03,0:10:45.54,Sign,,380,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Puppy Howling
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I have to do, cough up a furball?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Salamon, the\Nrookie form of Tailmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't she cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much more cuddly than her\Nultimate form of Angemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess she's back\Nto being a rookie because
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she used up all her\Nenergy during the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't allow pets in our apartment.\NHey, look! The sky's clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:10:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Floating in the sky upside down
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things just keep getting weird
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Tai and Kari are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but I have an educated guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna search where the\Nmonsters were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back when I find them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like an entire upside\Ndown continent in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't show up on radar
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or on any satellite pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.56,0:12:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no instruments of any kind can confirm\Nthat whatever it is, is really even there.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.93,0:12:26.01,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(0,300)}Water Bus Station      Tickets Sold Here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so afraid I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been terrified, T.K. Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt was with me the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come see Matt! And Daddy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:12:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:12:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a really long time since\Nall four of us were together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,check this out guys i've been\Nmonitoring the news reports
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the air force is sending in\Neverything they've got to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,figure out what this continent\Nin the sky really is they
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.04,0:13:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't know anything so far but\Nthey're assuming it's dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this talk i want mayday mayday\Nmayday i have to admit that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm a little jealous that matt\Nand tk found their parents
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Izzy too. I just hope my mom\Nand dad are all right. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how you feel me too huh someone's\Ncoming all right my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey I didn't tell him\Nhe could ride my scooter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jim have you seen my mom and dad\Nall the other families that were
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the convention center are fine\Nthrow back to normal Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The latest report we have from the\NAir Force Chief of Staff confirms
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the mysterious landmass in the\Nsky is not an illusion of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is very real and, after several\Nconfrontations, apparently very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's covering the whole sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be Myotismon's work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We defeated Myotismon for good this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we kicked booty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you heard the news report.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who else could be doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.84,0:14:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it matter who's doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something familiar\Nabout that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Infinity Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai, grab your telescope and get us\Na closer peek at that peak right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, the big one I'm pointing to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, like that helps me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, there are dozens\Nof mountains up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I found is a jetliner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ground Control, this is Flight 224.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have lost our vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is 224 to Ground Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have lost our landing vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commit Ground Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't land here now, and we can't turn\Nback with the fuel we have left on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? The alarm. All systems failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got about two seconds to\Nfigure out what's wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The airplane reached\Nthe edge of that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the sky and just headed straight down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll break up at this speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just get there in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kuwagamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon, Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon, Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.76,0:16:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gokimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, let's go, Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went right through!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon, get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night's going, Berger-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brought the plane down safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, how'd Kuwagamon get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came out of that land in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That giant continent is\Nactually the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you recognize that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know, it does\Nlook sort of familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, better have a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bring you now new footage\Nof some truly bizarre scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No official explanation has yet been\Ngiven for what you are seeing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we touch these Digimon, we'll\Nfreeze, just like the airplane's wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I fired my electro-shocker,\Nit passed right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Solomon, is that your world up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so, but the last time I was\Nthere, it was definitely right side up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been back in the real\Nworld for only a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But up there, time is much faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Years and years have passed by.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since we left the Digi-World\Nwhen it was such a mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had years and years to just get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine what\Nthe place looks like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all the problems in the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become our problem\Nhere in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've all got to go back. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first time we went to the\Ndigital world, our Digivice is less.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're coming too, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody,\Nhold out your digivices.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next stop, the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your arms and legs\Ninside the ride at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.36,0:18:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's working, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This light must be here to guide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all we have to do is follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry we have to leave now\Nthat we're finally back together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:18:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:18:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've made some selfish\Ndecisions of our own, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to let them do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be more\Nimportant than we realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world is doomed if\Nwe don't do something, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doing this to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys better get cranking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it's hard to\Nbelieve the fate of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world's in the hands of\Na bunch of kids like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess if the sun doesn't come up\Ntomorrow, we'll know you messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to have faith in\Nyour brother and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What they're doing is incredibly brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.22,0:19:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, sorry, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.55,0:19:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was only kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm going to make\Ndarn sure the sun does come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, I didn't know you had it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt! TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come home soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And take care of your sister, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought we'd volunteer\Nto leave our families behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if we'll ever see\Nthem again, but I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like, just knowing that they love\Nus gives us the power that we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of fear. My future I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not afraid of. I'm giving you a smile. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the middle of my heart, I'm a weak
